'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Weapons|weapon]] class.

Clubs primarily deal [[Damage types|blunt]] damage and feature high knockback. The knockback from clubs allows the player to keep enemies at arms' length and is sufficient to displace some enemies out of their effective attack range. 

{{See also|Clubs (Skill)}}

